The first source adaptation was run with signal.alarm(55).
The process terminated with exit status 142 after the alarm.
It produced no final JSON output and no stderr before termination.
The source is preserved as PATCH_SUPPORT_v0_timeout.py.
The root-index candidate omission was then identified algebraically and repaired.
The corrected run is recorded in PATCH_SUPPORT_run.log and PATCH_SUPPORT_output.json.
